"""Authoring-time validation of project configuration files.

Mirrors the per-package validation pattern (``memory/validation.py``,
``tools/validation.py``, ``skills/validation.py``): checks return
:class:`~rasa.mantle.validation_finding.ValidationFinding` objects so
:func:`rasa.mantle.validation.validate_project` can aggregate them.
"""

